1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,393
Maya has five Boxys.

3
00:00:07,393 --> 00:00:10,159
Each one does its own thing.

4
00:00:10,159 --> 00:00:12,300
Toys everywhere!

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,534
Nothing lines up.

6
00:00:14,534 --> 00:00:18,297
Kira is the captain of the toy boxes.

7
00:00:18,297 --> 00:00:19,747
Tweet!

8
00:00:19,747 --> 00:00:22,194
She blows her whistle.

9
00:00:22,194 --> 00:00:24,534
The boxes line up.

10
00:00:24,534 --> 00:00:26,835
This box wraps.

11
00:00:26,835 --> 00:00:29,268
That box carries.

12
00:00:29,268 --> 00:00:31,609
That box taps.

13
00:00:31,609 --> 00:00:33,204
Oh no!

14
00:00:33,204 --> 00:00:35,797
One box tips over.

15
00:00:35,797 --> 00:00:39,308
Kira puts a new box in its place.

16
00:00:39,308 --> 00:00:41,662
The line gets long.

17
00:00:41,662 --> 00:00:44,255
Kira adds one more.

18
00:00:44,255 --> 00:00:47,526
Now the whole row works in step.

19
00:00:47,526 --> 00:00:50,000
That is E K S.

20
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,367
Now you know Kira!

21
00:00:52,367 --> 00:00:57,061
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

